@startuml
' UML Component 03 — Platform capabilities
' Evidence status: Implemented source modules; external engines are configurable.
' Updated: 2026-07-29.

!pragma layout elk
top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam PageMargin 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #14532D
}

component "HTTP / event delivery" as Delivery
component "Business Commands / Queries" as Business
component "Accountability\nnotifications · Audit" as Accountability
component "Query runtime\nsearch · cache" as QueryRuntime
component "Operations\nobservability · logger · errors" as Operations
component "Outer composition\nconsumer ports → adapters" as Composition #F3E8FF

Delivery --> Business : one intent
Business ..> Composition : consumer-owned ports
Composition --> Accountability : adapter binding
Composition --> QueryRuntime : adapter binding
Business ..> Operations : safe telemetry

note bottom of Accountability
Audit is canonical evidence.
User Activity is not a runtime component.
end note

@enduml
